ca89a5cbe0936467 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-5gql2z-8464e24b54cbdfbcca89a5cbe0936467 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-gx8yj-94c7543a5cd5b70f8930f1b45b68105d sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-gx8yj-94c7543a5cd5b70f8930f1b45b68105d av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-mnhd8y6b-e58a4eeaa2ddcc103410d83bb00be4b0 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Tym razem, we wsp\u00f3\u0142pracy z Polsk\u0105 Agencj\u0105 Inwestycji i Handlu (PAIH), b\u0119dziemy obecni na targach <strong>Automechanika Mexico City<\/strong> w dniach <strong>08\u201310.07.2026 r.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Zapraszamy do odwiedzenia polskiego pawilonu narodowego na stoisku nr <strong>4844<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>To \u015bwietna okazja do rozmowy o wsp\u00f3\u0142pracy.<\/p>\n<p>Zapraszamy do umawiania spotka\u0144 biznesowych drog\u0105 mailow\u0105: <a href=\"mailto:export@venol.de\">export@venol.de<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Do zobaczenia w Meksyku!<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-2794a3-273bbf8bb532904d9a42034de2fb55c9 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-4  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-mnhda2bf-f62663f63ff2534ac7062f38c8719cb9\">\n.avia-image-container.av-mnhda2bf-f62663f63ff2534ac7062f38c8719cb9 img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-m